@*
=========================================================
FILE: FormMessage.razor

PURPOSE:
An error or information message on a sign-in form.

RESPONSIBILITIES:
- Render an error or information message on a sign-in form

IMPORTANT NOTES:
- Markup only. Text comes from OperationsText (L-10); values come from the endpoint
- Tenant surface: shows the tenant name, never "Vixly" (ADR-0012 W-1)
- Placeholder look: Frontend/UI designs the final experience
=========================================================
*@
@if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Error))
{
    <VxMessage Type="VxMessageType.Error">@Error</VxMessage>
}
@if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Info))
{
    <VxMessage Type="VxMessageType.Info">@Info</VxMessage>
}

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public string? Error { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public string? Info { get; set; }
}
